  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of knowledge and experiences regarding EU integration to the National School of Public Administration. NSPA, in Warsaw, phase I. This phase includes a studytour for representatives from NSPA to Sweden where experts will assist in transfer of knowledge. The experi ences will serve as a starting point for phase II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklig av EU-kompetensen hos National School of Public Administration i Polen, fas I. Denna inledande fas best&#xE5;r i  studiebes&#xF6;k f&#xF6;r medarbetare vid NSPA till Sverige d&#xE4;r experter vid svenska institutioner bist&#xE5;r med kompetens&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring. Erfarenheterna fr&#xE5;n denna fas kommer att l&#xE4;gga grunden f&#xF6;r projektplan inf&#xF6;r fas II.</narrative>
  </description>
